## update ingredient popup
PATCH http://localhost:3000/owner/update-stock-ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json
owner_id: 1
branch_id: 3
{
  "update_id": 1,
  "quantity_in_stock": 52,
  "total_volume": 50000,
  "net_volume": 1000,
  "expiration_date": "2026-02-27"
}

